        <summary>Called when the session is closed.</summary>
        <remarks>
          <para>Called when the session is closed.</para>
          <para>A session may be closed explicitly via AppInteractionSession.close() or implicitly by the system when the session reaches its maximum duration timeout.</para>
          <para>If the session is already closed, the listener will be invoked immediately.</para>
